# Copy to .env (or just export these) before running `npm start`.
# APEX can run on EITHER NVIDIA (Nemotron) OR Anthropic (Claude). Set at least one key.
# Auto-select prefers NVIDIA, then Claude. Override with APEX_PROVIDER.

# --- NVIDIA (Nemotron) — preferred ---
# Get one at https://build.nvidia.com/  (keys start with nvapi-)
NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-...
# NVIDIA_MODEL=nvidia/llama-3.3-nemotron-super-49b-v1
# NVIDIA_BASE_URL=https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1
# NVIDIA_MAX_TOKENS=8192

# --- Anthropic (Claude) — fallback ---
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# APEX_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# --- Provider selection ---
# Which provider to use. If unset, APEX auto-picks: NVIDIA if its key is set,
# otherwise Anthropic. Set this to force one (must have that provider's key).
# APEX_PROVIDER=nvidia

# --- Other optional overrides ---
# Default 8002 avoids clash with Stage A on :8000.
# PORT=8002
